gaps=[{'id':'L32-COVERAGE-01','status':'open','sourcePages':[974],'finding':'The actual worked Gaussian center calculation is not tested. Existing Q053–Q055 distinguish the formula, normalization and binomial weights but do not require evaluating the continuous center 0.2203 and its finite 3×3 normalized center 0.2497 at sigma 0.85. A substantive integrated calculation can replace the duplicated Q081 or deepen a flagged Gaussian item, preserving the source missing-factor conflict. Do not count this as a different Gaussian model or silently equate0.2497 with exact 1/4.'},{'id':'L32-COVERAGE-02','status':'open code/output qualification','sourcePages':[969,970],'finding':'The literal normhist call is not numerically connected to the source raw-CDF formula. Current toolbox 2.4.1 calls OpenCV equalizeHist, whose minimum-CDF adjustment differs from raw255*c. Independent declared toy input [[0,1],[1,2]] gives [[0,170],[170,255]] in the library, versus nearest-rounded raw CDF [[64,191],[191,255]]. Add a narrowly version-bound code/output comparison or document an explicit exclusion of literal library-output equivalence. It must not be represented as an exact reproduction of unavailable pollen_image.tif.'}]
coverage={'reviewerId':REVIEWER,'completedAt':now,'actualPagesInspected':list(range(954,987)),'substantivePages':list(range(957,984)),'nonSubstantiveOrRepetition':[{'page':954,'reason':'Title'},{'page':955,'reason':'Objectives roadmap'},{'page':956,'reason':'Contents roadmap'},{'page':984,'reason':'Summary repeats inspected substantive concepts'},{'page':985,'reason':'Bibliography'},{'page':986,'reason':'Closing'}],'gaps':gaps,'boundedScope':'All arrays, diagram cells, displayed equations, code blocks and outputs were visually checked; existing legitimate question coverage spans all 27 substantive pages. Do not claim 87 unique concepts simply from 87 one-question records: closely related definitions and numerical cases remain one concept with several examination angles. Coverage closure remains pending quality repairs and the two bounded dispositions.','sourceQualifications':'Retain all 14 author source qualifications. Independently additionally distinguish OpenCV equalization from raw CDF; current Image literal empty crop raises ValueError rather than returning a valid empty Image; rank is currently a deprecated functional wrapper. Missing external TIFF assets are not an inspection failure because actual source raster pages were viewed, but they limit exact runtime reproduction.'}
